     Android with ``--gpu-context=android`` only.
 
+``--moltenvk-surface-size=<WxH>``
+    Notify the MoltenVK gpu context that the embedding application changed the
+    ``drawableSize`` of the ``CAMetalLayer`` passed via ``--wid``. Setting this
+    option resizes the swapchain to the layer's current ``drawableSize`` and
+    redraws immediately, also while paused. The value itself is only used to
+    detect changes; set it to the new ``drawableSize`` after updating the layer.
+
+    Changes are also picked up automatically while the VO is running, so this
+    is mainly needed to update a paused or idle player.
+
+    macOS/iOS with ``--gpu-context=moltenvk`` only.
+
 ``--d3d11-composition-size=<WxH>``
     Set size of the output for d3d11 composition mode.
     When use composition mode, there is no window, must set the output size by
